# A note that embeds a picture: tests/drive.rs puts an 8×4 PNG, red over blue, in the
# workspace. The reader draws it under the embed's name as the image view's text fallback
# does: its kind, size and bytes, then a thumbnail of half blocks (here two rows). An embed of
# a picture that isn't there (Kīlauea's) stays its name.
size 120x30
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
wait-for example-workspace
write Inbox/Lake.md # Lake\n\n![[lava-lake.png]]\n\n![[kilauea-lava-lake.jpg]]\n
keys p
type lake
wait-for Lake
keys enter
wait-for Inbox/Lake  reading
wait-for 🖼 lava-lake.png
expect │ PNG image · 8×4 ·
expect │ ▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀
expect 🖼 kilauea-lava-lake.jpg
screen
keys esc
wait-gone reading · Esc / q back
keys q
exits 0
